Rs. 499! #SolviraSkin", "images": []}, {"id": "S4", "label": "Clean post", "hint": "Follows every rule, so it should pass cleanly", "title": "Clean product post", "channel": "instagram", "post_type": "product", "product": "Daily Shield Sunscreen", "partner": false, "caption": "Meet Daily Shield Sunscreen: SPF 50 PA++++ in a light gel for everyday use. ₹649 for 50 ml on solvira.in. #SolviraSkin", "images": []}, {"id": "S5", "label": "Barrier Cream claims", "hint": "Dermatologist claim, a medical claim, a comparison, ''chemical-free''", "title": "Product post with health claims", "channel": "instagram", "post_type": "product", "product": "Barrier Cream", "partner": false, "caption": "Our Barrier Cream is dermatologist recommended and cures eczema. Unlike other brands, it''s chemical-free. #SolviraSkin", "images": []}, {"id": "S6", "label": "LinkedIn update", "hint": "Misspelled name, emojis, a number with no fact, a confidential name", "title": "LinkedIn company update", "channel": "linkedin", "post_type": "company update", "product": "Brand", "partner": false, "caption": "Big news 🎉🚀✨ Solveira is now in 40 cities! And a sneak peek: Project Dawn is coming soon.", "images": []}]}'::jsonb)
